+/*
+ * RF 4.6 Phase 2B declaration order with six meta fields removed and all
+ * vectors expanded in ascending component order. The declaration and scalar
+ * types were reviewed against the RF 4.6.0 baseline at
+ * 118e9120260bb33f46df4f92052fb0e9fd4e9ebc; that baseline is not a clean
+ * implementation-support pin for this uncommitted slice. Array indexes are
+ * field-id minus one. Names remain comments so the firmware registry stores no
+ * strings. The compact domain registry defines both wire shape and the strict
+ * semantic allowlist without reading live configuration.
+ */
